# 공개 API 계약: project_path_gateway_update KEY PATH (갱신, 기능 004 US3·US4, contracts/library-api-add-update.md)
# 가상 파일 시스템은 call 사이에 바뀐 상태를 이어 주지 않는다. 결과는 같은 call의 op write 원문으로 확인하고,
# 뒤이은 조회·검증은 바뀐 원문을 fs로 주고 caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT로 루트를 준 별도 사례로 확인한다.
target lib-session project_path_gateway
layer api
fs file /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.project-path-gateway
fs file /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content DOCS_DIR=docs

# 인자·초기화·인자 규칙 (계약 2절 1~8행, FR-002·FR-003·FR-010·FR-015): 데이터 파일을 읽거나 쓰지 않는다
case edit-invalid-update-argument-count
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_update
call project_path_gateway_update DOCS_DIR
call project_path_gateway_update DOCS_DIR docs extra
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_update: 인자는 KEY와 PATH 2개여야 합니다
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_update: 인자는 KEY와 PATH 2개여야 합니다
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_update: 인자는 KEY와 PATH 2개여야 합니다
op returned project_path_gateway_update 2
op returned project_path_gateway_update 2
op returned project_path_gateway_update 2

case edit-invalid-update-not-initialized
call project_path_gateway_update NEW_DIR new
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_update: 초기화되지 않았습니다. project_path_gateway_init을 먼저 호출하세요
op returned project_path_gateway_update 2

case edit-invalid-update-key-lowercase
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_update docs new
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_update: 키 형식이 잘못되었습니다(대문자로 시작, 대문자·숫자·_만 허용): docs
op returned project_path_gateway_update 2

case edit-invalid-update-path-empty
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_update NEW_DIR \e
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_update: 경로가 비어 있습니다
op returned project_path_gateway_update 2

case edit-invalid-update-path-absolute
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_update NEW_DIR /abs
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_update: 경로는 /로 시작할 수 없습니다: /abs
op returned project_path_gateway_update 2

case edit-invalid-update-path-parent-segment
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_update NEW_DIR ../out
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_update: 경로에 .. 세그먼트를 쓸 수 없습니다: ../out
op returned project_path_gateway_update 2

case edit-invalid-update-path-carriage-return
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_update NEW_DIR a\rb
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_update: 경로에 CR 문자를 쓸 수 없습니다
op returned project_path_gateway_update 2

case edit-invalid-update-path-line-feed
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_update NEW_DIR a\nb
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_update: 경로에 LF 문자를 쓸 수 없습니다
op returned project_path_gateway_update 2

case edit-invalid-update-key-and-path-both-wrong
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_update docs /abs
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_update: 키 형식이 잘못되었습니다(대문자로 시작, 대문자·숫자·_만 허용): docs
op returned project_path_gateway_update 2

# 갱신 성공 (US3-1·3, FR-021·FR-022·FR-023·FR-024, 계약 3절): 대상 줄 내용만 바뀐다.
# 새 원문은 규칙을 통과한 KEY=PATH 한 줄과 이미 검사를 통과한 기존 줄 바이트로만 이루어져 데이터 파일 규칙을 만족한다.
case update-middle-key-in-mixed-file
fs file /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content # 경로 항목
content
content A_DIR=a
content B_DIR=b
content
content C_DIR=c
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_update B_DIR new/b
status 0
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf
op write /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf #\s경로\s항목\n\nA_DIR=a\nB_DIR=new/b\n\nC_DIR=c\n
op move /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_update 0

case update-same-path-writes-nothing
fs file /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content DOCS_DIR=docs
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_update DOCS_DIR docs
status 0
op returned project_path_gateway_update 0

case update-last-line-without-lf-is-target
fs file /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content A_DIR=a
content-raw B_DIR=b
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_update B_DIR x
status 0
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf
op write /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf A_DIR=a\nB_DIR=x
op move /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_update 0

case update-prefix-key-only-exact-line
fs file /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content DOC=d
content DOCS_DIR=docs
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_update DOC e
status 0
op copy-preserve /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf
op write /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf DOC=e\nDOCS_DIR=docs\n
op move /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_update 0

