# 미등록 키 거부 (US3-2, FR-013): 항목을 새로 더하지 않는다
case update-missing-key
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_update X_DIR x
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_update: 등록되지 않은 키입니다: X_DIR
op returned project_path_gateway_update 2

# 갱신 뒤 조회 (US3-1): call 사이 파일 상태가 이어지지 않으므로 갱신 뒤 원문을 fs로 준다
case update-then-get-prints-new-path
fs file /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content A_DIR=a
content B_DIR=new/b
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_get B_DIR
status 0
out /t/root/new/b
op returned project_path_gateway_get 0

# 데이터 파일 오류 (US4-3·4, FR-011): 기능 001과 같은 보고, 반환 2, 변경 없음
case edit-invalid-update-data-file-violation
fs file /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content DOCS_DIR=docs
content bad line
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_update DOCS_DIR new
status 2
err project-path-gateway: /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf:2: KEY=경로 형식이 아닙니다
op returned project_path_gateway_update 2

case edit-invalid-update-data-file-missing
fs file /t/other/.tools/project-path-gateway/.project-path-gateway
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/other
call project_path_gateway_update DOCS_DIR new
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_update: 데이터 파일을 읽을 수 없습니다: /t/other/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_update 2

case edit-invalid-update-data-file-is-directory
fs file /t/other/.tools/project-path-gateway/.project-path-gateway
fs dir /t/other/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/other
call project_path_gateway_update DOCS_DIR new
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_update: 데이터 파일을 읽을 수 없습니다: /t/other/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_update 2

case edit-invalid-update-tool-directory-denied
fs deny /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_update DOCS_DIR new
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_update: 데이터 파일을 읽을 수 없습니다: /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_update 2

# 쓰기 실패 (US4, FR-030~FR-034, SC-005): 데이터 파일은 그대로, 임시 파일은 지운다
case edit-write-fails-update-data-file-is-link
fs file /t/root/real.conf
content DOCS_DIR=docs
fs link /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf ../../real.conf
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
call project_path_gateway_update DOCS_DIR new
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_update: 데이터 파일이 심볼릭 링크라 바꿀 수 없습니다: /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_update 2

case edit-write-fails-update-data-file-readonly
fs readonly /t/root/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
caller-var PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT /t/root
